# SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-SA-4.0
# A FIT workout file, written by hand from the public FIT protocol and profile 21.218: one 5-min
# step for every target type, with the offsets of the profile: power up to 1000 is % FTP, above
# it watts + 1000; heart rate up to 100 is % of the maximum, above it bpm + 100. A target_value
# above 0 is a zone; 0 means the custom low and high, a range.

0e 20 u16:21218 {size} 2e 46 49 54 {hcrc}

40 00 00 u16:0 03   00 01 00   01 02 84   04 04 86
00 05 u16:255 u32:1100000000

41 00 00 u16:26 04   04 01 00   0b 01 00   06 02 84   08 10 07
01 02 05 u16:15 str16"All targets"

